  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j7lnXpb.png\" alt=\"banner1\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/structural-beyond\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structural-beyond\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://gamejolt.com/games/structural_beyond_mc/944658\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h85Hg1b.png\" alt=\"GameJolt\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://d4vide106.itch.io/structuralbeyond-mc\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qz2uWJJ.png\" alt=\"Itch.io\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n   <strong>🌟 Structural Beyond 🌟</strong><br/>\n   一款沉浸式模组，旨在通过全新的原版风格建筑丰富《我的世界》。完美融入原版玩法，本模组精心挑选了多种独特结构，并将它们自然地生成于不同的生物群系中。\n</p>\n\n## ✨ 特性\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  🌍 <strong>探索 12+ 种独特结构</strong>\n</p>\n  \n  - 🏕️ **营地** - 一个带有战利品和惊喜的小露营点。\n  - 🗼 **方塔** - 一座守护着宝藏的神秘高塔。\n  - 🔮 **法师小屋** - 一位强大法师的居所。\n  - 🌊 **水下之剑** - 沉没于海底的传奇武器。\n  - 🪨 **深板岩石柱** - 深埋地下的宏伟石柱结构。\n  - 🍄 **蘑菇屋** - 隐藏在蘑菇群系中的温馨小屋。\n  - 🌱 **大地傀儡** - 守护大地的自然守护者。\n\n<p align=\"right\">\n  🏰 <strong>契合原版设定的融合</strong><br/>\n  每种结构均采用原版风格设计，能够与《我的世界》的生物群系及世界构建自然融合。\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  🚧 <strong>目前处于 Beta 测试阶段</strong> 🚧<br/>\n  敬请期待更多结构与优化更新！\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  <strong>📢 有反馈或发现 BUG？</strong><br/>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/thfPJ7QAPJ\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_46h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"right\">\n  <strong>💖 通过捐赠支持我！</strong><br/>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/checkout/InfinityWonderful?rid=0&cadence=1&custom=1\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a><br/>\n  <em>您的支持将帮助我持续优化和更新模组。非常感谢！</em>\n</p>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>🔧 兼容的模组加载器</summary>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_46h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" />\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_46h.png\" alt=\"Forge\" />\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/unsupported/quilt_46h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\" />\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/structural-beyond-sb-datapack\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1G0f1rR.png\" alt=\"Datapack\" />\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>🌟 整合包使用许可</summary>\n  <p align=\"left\">\n    您可以自由地将 **Structural Beyond** 收录到您的整合包中，前提是需注明并链接回原模组发布页。您也可以分享该模组，但请务必为创作者 D4vide106 署名，并提供指向本页面或 Modrinth、CurseForge 及其他官方授权平台的链接。\n\n  </p>\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9AdFsCE.png\" alt=\"Creator\" /> 由 D4vide106 制作</strong><br/>\n  <em>这是我的首个模组——感谢您的支持！</em>\n</p>",
